## Why This Is Asked
Tests knowledge of Azure OpenAI, Cognitive Search integration, governance, and telemetry in a realistic multi-tenant setup.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation and quotas
- PII redaction pipeline with Text Analytics
- Vector search via Cognitive Search
- API Management policies for rate limiting
- Model versioning and drift monitoring

## Code Example
```javascript
// backend: wrapper around OpenAI call with per-tenant context
async function answerForTenant(req, tenantId) {
  const redacted = redactPII(req.prompt);
  const docs = await searchIndex(tenantId, redacted);
  const context = buildContext(docs);
  return await openAiChat(tenantId, context, redacted);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you implement drift detection for the retrieved docs and model outputs?
- How would you test per-tenant quotas and prevent data leakage across tenants?

## Why This Is Asked
